commit 40a7f6cdfda011343a98db5b44108a46a20427b7

C03: a compound of a read and an incomplete request runs the read and ends with the one question the other clause needs (AUDIO1577)

AUDIO858 measured H0067 «subí el volumen y decime qué fecha es» as a clarification of the amount that dropped the date; H0527 «listá las ventanas y enfocá la mejor» resolved nothing. `deferred_clarification_split` reads two clauses joined by «y» where one is a read the turn can do (system.time, the window listing) and the other needs a question before any effect (a relative volume change without an amount; a window named only as «la mejor»): the read resolves alone, the decision path treats the compound neither as a clarification nor as an unresolved compound, the arguments ground on the read clause, and the composer reports the read and ends the final with that one question (an answer that claims the volume changed or a window was focused, or that carries no question, is rejected with a hint naming the question). The indeterminate-window clause regex moves to effect_intent and is shared. The registry recogniser changes only for these two rows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


